{"id":"an-pvs-7","slug":"an-pvs-7","name":"AN/PVS-7","aliases":[],"kind":"gear","category":"night-vision","subcategory":"Biocular night vision device","description":"The AN/PVS-7 is a single tube biocular night vision device. Third-generation image intensifiers are able to be installed and are standard for military night vision. Most newer PVS-7 intensifier tubes are auto-gated to prevent image intensifier damage if exposed to intense light. The goggles have a built-in infrared Illuminator for low-light situations. They are waterproof and charged with nitrogen to prevent internal condensation while moving between extreme temperatures.","facts":[],"specifications":[{"group":"Specification","items":[{"label":"Type","value":"Passive/Active"},{"label":"Weight","value":"520 grams"},{"label":"Weight","value":"(680 grams including head mount)"},{"label":"Field of View","value":"40 degrees"}]},{"group":"Production","items":[{"label":"Designer","value":"ITT Industries"},{"label":"Designer","value":"Litton Industries"},{"label":"Designed","value":"1982"},{"label":"Manufacturer","value":"ITT Industries"},{"label":"Manufacturer","value":"Litton Industries"},{"label":"Manufacturer","value":"Northrop Grumman"},{"label":"Manufacturer","value":"L3 Communications"},{"label":"Produced","value":"1985–present"}]},{"group":"Service","items":[{"label":"Origin","value":"United States"},{"label":"In Service","value":"1988–present"}]}],"specIndex":{"Type":"Passive/Active","Weight":"520 grams","Field of View":"40 degrees","Designer":"ITT Industries","Designed":"1982","Manufacturer":"ITT Industries","Produced":"1985–present","Origin":"United States","In Service":"1988–present"},"images":{"hero":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/AN_PVS-7_Cyclops.JPG","descriptionUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AN_PVS-7_Cyclops.JPG","width":2850,"height":1890,"license":"Public domain","attribution":"U.S. Department of Defense"},"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipe